*  WITNESS for HB_DTP and HB_DTPRCP -- a pattern value built at run time (a deferred variable, a capture, ARB) held in a variable across allocation churn, then matched.
        Q = 'abc'
        P = ARB . W *Q . V
        I = 0
CHURN   S = S 'x'
        I = LT(I,300) I + 1                        :S(CHURN)
        'zzabczz' P                              :F(NO)
        OUTPUT = 'DTP-' W '-' V '-' SIZE(S)      :(END)
NO      OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
